@page "/about"
@inject SiteImages Images

<PageTitle>About – Fixlosophy Bike Repair</PageTitle>

<div class="page-hero page-hero--sm">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">Our Story</p>
        <h1>About Fixlosophy</h1>
        <p>Born from a love of cycling and a frustration with overpriced, opaque bike shops.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-intro">
            <div class="about-text">
                <h2>Why We Exist</h2>
                <p>Fixlosophy started in 2015 when founder Marco Velo got a repair quote for €400 at a shop that couldn't even explain what they were going to do. He left, fixed the bike himself in his garage, and thought: <em>there has to be a better way.</em></p>
                <p>Today, Fixlosophy is a full-service bike repair shop built on three simple principles: <strong>honesty, expertise, and speed.</strong> We tell you exactly what's wrong, what it'll cost, and we get it done fast — no waffle, no surprises.</p>
                <p>We've worked on everything from beat-up commuters to high-end race machines, and we treat every bike with the same level of care. Because every ride matters.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-aside">
                <figure class="about-photo">
                    <img src="@Images.Url("shop/street-view.jpg")" alt="The Fixlosophy shop seen from the street, bikes parked outside"
                         width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                         onerror="this.closest('figure').style.display='none'" />
                    <figcaption>The shop, on a rare sunny afternoon.</figcaption>
                </figure>
                <div class="about-stats">
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">9+</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Years in business</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">12k+</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Bikes repaired</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">4.9&#11088;</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Average rating</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <div class="stat-number">6</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Certified mechanics</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- TEAM -->
<section class="section team-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <p class="section-eyebrow">The People</p>
            <h2>Meet the Team</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Our mechanics are certified, passionate riders themselves — they understand what you need because they ride too.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="team-grid">
            <div class="team-card">
                <div class="team-avatar">MV</div>
                <h3>Marco Velo</h3>
                <p class="team-role">Founder &amp; Head Mechanic</p>
                <p>10 years professional mechanic. Former team mechanic for a regional cycling team. Specialist in drivetrain and custom builds.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="team-card">
                <div class="team-avatar">AL</div>
                <h3>Aria Lund</h3>
                <p class="team-role">E-Bike Specialist</p>
                <p>Certified Bosch and Shimano EP8 technician. 7 years servicing electric bikes. Mountain biker and trail builder.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="team-card">
                <div class="team-avatar">DJ</div>
                <h3>Danny Joost</h3>
                <p class="team-role">Workshop Mechanic</p>
                <p>MTB and road mechanic with 5 years experience. Specialises in suspension, hydraulic brakes, and wheel builds.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- VALUES -->
<section class="section values-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <p class="section-eyebrow">What We Stand For</p>
            <h2>Our Values</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="values-grid">
            <div class="value-card">
                <div class="value-icon">&#128065;</div>
                <h3>Transparency</h3>
                <p>You'll always know what work needs doing and exactly what it costs before we start. No surprises.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card">
                <div class="value-icon">&#127891;</div>
                <h3>Expertise</h3>
                <p>All our mechanics hold professional certifications and ride regularly. They fix bikes because they love bikes.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card">
                <div class="value-icon">&#9889;</div>
                <h3>Speed</h3>
                <p>We respect your time. Most jobs are done same day. We'll always give you a realistic turnaround upfront.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card">
                <div class="value-icon">&#127758;</div>
                <h3>Sustainability</h3>
                <p>We repair, not replace where possible. We recycle parts, use eco-friendly cleaning products, and love cycling as green transport.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container cta-banner-content">
        <h2>Come and meet the team</h2>
        <p>Drop in during opening hours or book your repair online. We'd love to see your bike.</p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get in Touch</a>
            <a href="/services" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">View Services</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
